      },
      {
        "finding": "At fixed effective batch size, accuracy generally improves as the number of mSAM shards increases to about 32; further increases produce deterioration or marginal improvements.",
        "proposed_claim": "Increasing the number of mSAM perturbation shards has a saturating or nonmonotonic accuracy benefit in the tested CIFAR-100 CNNs.",
